{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/134317-new-roleplayers-introduction","id":134317,"title":"new roleplayers introduction","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-12T13:52:58-07:00","id":134317,"title":"new roleplayers introduction","content":"I have a few friends who really want to get into role-playing but both of the story tellers I play with are having a hard time scheduling time (main group has an elitist player they are planning to boot and dont want new players turned off). So I am thinking of doing an introduction via hunter. Wod is a simpler system so easier to teach the basics to new players and I think hunter could be a good way to enter. <br /> <br /> my request is more as a still new st what plot hooks would you suggest? <br /> <br /> my plan: have it based on our town with city maps, have Npc to hint at possible plot hooks if they ever get unsure what to do, be vague with monsters to catch their imagination, talk with them about themes and taboo topics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T14:05:34-07:00","id":134333,"title":"","content":"Is this a one shot or a long term game?<br /> <br /> For a one shot my suggestion would be to use a Legend Slasher (ignore the bad Undertaking rules in Slasher, just pick some appropriate Dread Powers and Banes/Bans from GMC ephemeral beings).<br /> <br /> Start off with communal PC generation, to keep things simple for the newbies I'd go for Tier 1, The Union or perhaps the Maiden's Blood Sisterhood.<br /> <br /> The plot hook is simple. Teenagers who enact a silly ritual are dying. However the authorities refuse to admit this (make it clear to the new people that in the WoD most people wilfully deny clear evidence of the supernatural - and that this is an explicit difference between the real world and the WoD). Because there's so many authority figures denying any connection to the ritual you still get teenagers doing it and dying.<br /> <br /> So the plot hook is simple. Enact the ritual, call the Slasher to you, and blast it to bits. However there's a catch, you don't know what can and can't hurt it. So you have investigative scenes looking for clues and perhaps building up Conditions that can be used in the final fight. When you're ready, stand between two mirrors, chant bloody Mary or what have you, then enjoy the climatic showdown.<br /> <br /> <br /> This is what came to mind as a simple and self contained story hook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T14:16:40-07:00","id":134343,"title":"","content":"Starts as short maybe 3 sessions unless they want more which I'd hope for. <br /> <br /> I like the idea you presented and makes me concider one I had more. Them stumbling into the shadow and having to find a way back. But I'd be nice and make sure they understood the system first of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T14:45:55-07:00","id":134385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/134317-new-roleplayers-introduction?p=134343#post134343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Them stumbling into the shadow and having to find a way back. But I'd be nice and make sure they understood the system first of course.</div> </div> </div> </div> I would describe that as a blue book mortals campaign not a Hunter campaign. Hunters aren't trying to find a way back, they're pushing forward.<br /> <br /> It's not a bad idea; it's just that I'd suggest that the blue book line might have more useful ideas for that concept than the Hunter line.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T14:54:09-07:00","id":134400,"title":"","content":"Well I forget the term but thin spot in gauntlet mortals can accidentally step through. A plot I'd give once they think they understand the world. If they think all monsters are bad have a werewolf save them and reveal after they are back. Or other such things to drive character development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com